  "prefLabel": "Rev 803.04 Single Entity Reorganizations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 803.04 Single Entity Reorganizations. The tax imposed by RSA 78-B shall not apply to single-entity reorganizations pursuant to Internal Revenue Code § 368(a)(1)(F) governing mere changes in identity, form, or place of organization, or 368(a)(1)(E) governing recapitalization.\n\nSource. #10665, eff 9-9-14; ss by 14071, eff 9-10-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev800.html"
